&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,11,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Lead efforts to enhance product management frameworks, mentoring other product managers and contributing to company-wide initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;5 - 8 years of required experience in product management and/or customer discovery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_4293685bd03f679d-59&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
