&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in Agile planning methods, practices, and managing products through discovery, launch, and continuous review.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_4293685bd03f679d-62&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
