&lt;p&gt;We’re on a mission to become the go-to destination for students across Europe to find a trusted home away from home. We make every step of the rental journey simple and seamless, so students can focus on what really matters: studying, exploring, and growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With HousingAnywhere, Kamernet, and Studapart under our roof, we’re Europe’s largest student rental platform. You’ll find us in Rotterdam, Paris, and Cergy, always guided by our four core values: Ownership, We are enablers, We are changemakers, and We are connectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Help people find their next home with absolute certainty.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moving to a new country is an adventure, but finding a home shouldn’t be the hardest part. At HousingAnywhere, we’re revolutionizing renting by building a platform that helps people confidently rent a home abroad.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design isn&#39;t here to polish screens. It&#39;s here to shape the product. We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to own the Listing &amp;amp; Finding experience. You will define what discovering a home feels like: fast, relevant, trustworthy, and human.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the design owner for one of the most important journeys in our marketplace, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the long-term vision for the search and discovery experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead projects from early discovery through launch and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use qualitative research, behavioural data, and experimentation to make decisions, not opinions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success, measure impact, and continuously improve your solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the quality bar across the design team through thoughtful critique and craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our design principles, design system, and the way we build the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate deeply. Design with absolute purpose.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside Product, Engineering, Research, and Data as an equal partner to challenge assumptions, validate ideas, and turn ambiguity into a product that genuinely improves people&#39;s lives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We move fast, we think ahead, and we focus on what our audience truly needs. You&#39;ll have the freedom to influence your team’s strategy in an environment that values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elegant interaction design and meaningful micro-interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear design principles and consistent systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accessible experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality over shortcuts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shipping fast matters. Shipping something we&#39;re proud of matters even more. If you thrive on autonomy and solving complex puzzles, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 7+ years of experience designing complex digital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product thinking and problem framing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interaction and visual design craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in marketplaces, search or discovery products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running discovery and validating ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with data, metrics and experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating closely with engineers and product managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio showing not only what you designed – but why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holidays, minimum-based not maximum!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position based in our Rotterdam office with hybrid working policy (2 office days).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work remotely for up to 2 months per year!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1,000 EUR personal development budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete coverage for commuting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal equipment, including laptop and ergonomic setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gym membership discount with GoVital or OneFit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dutch/English classes budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Variable pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diverse international community (46+ nationalities).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet-friendly office in Rotterdam city centre.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-building events and after-work drinks every Friday.&lt;/li&gt;
