&lt;h3 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;🧰 &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;You will work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
