&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are fluent in French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;It will be a plus if you also&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Speak Spanish, Portuguese or German.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have experience working with international clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have worked in payments, fintech, SaaS or another fast-growing technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
