&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR FUTURE, ON DEMAND&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal blend of stability and flexibility. A genuinely human employer that cares for people and the planet. True autonomy to shape what comes next, for us and you. This is the perfect platform to take your career where you want.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Back in 2005, we pioneered Europe’s first TV streaming service. Today, we&#39;re a leading TV streaming provider with millions of monthly users, and since 2021 we&#39;ve been ClimatePartner-certified. Over 200 colleagues of 47 nationalities. We’re the grown-up start-up, helping to shape a better future since day one.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;That hasn’t changed, even if the world has. We’re friendly, international, inclusive – and our people say we’re reliable and transparent, too. It’s why they trust us and believe in what we do.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Principal Engineer QA as a senior individual contributor. You will define how quality risk is assessed, measured, and gated across the full streaming &lt;/span&gt;path - and embed that craft into engineering teams, who own day-to-day tests and suite health.&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality strategy &amp;amp; risk &lt;/strong&gt;- Build and maintain a living risk model for the streaming chain. Raise effort where failure hurts most. Make coverage vs. speed and pre-release vs. production trade-offs explicit with product and eng.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Release constraints &amp;amp; quality gates&lt;/strong&gt; - Define what “releasable” means for backend, middleware, and clients - including how continuous backend/middleware delivery is gated relative to client store cadences (web/TV/mobile). Keep gates fast, trustworthy, and hard to bypass.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rollout practice (build with the teams)&lt;/strong&gt; - Define and establish staged rollout, canary, and rollback strategies together with eng and SRE/ops. Own the definition; establish and operate them collaboratively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test architecture&lt;/strong&gt; - Set the pyramid and ownership boundaries (unit through E2E, performance, playback/stream validation) so each layer has a clear home inside eng. Drive cross-stack design that exercises real policy and format decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident &amp;amp; reliability partnership&lt;/strong&gt; - Join major quality incidents with a quality lens; strengthen production feedback for streaming health; turn escapes into durable tests, monitors, gate changes, and rollout improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tooling &amp;amp; automation standards &lt;/strong&gt;- Set practical standards for frameworks, CI integration, test data, environments, and reporting so teams share patterns with clear ownership and measurable ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-enabled quality engineering&lt;/strong&gt; - Define where AI raises quality leverage: test generation and maintenance, risk-based test selection, failure triage, and incident analysis. Set standards for AI-assisted testing and shape quality expectations for AI-authored code as delivery speed and change volume increase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentoring &amp;amp; influence&lt;/strong&gt; - Embed quality craft into eng: risk-based testing, quality in PRs, middleware policy and multi-platform client testing. Socialize lightweight, strong-default standards (definition of done, flake policy, critical-path coverage). Influence design reviews when quality risk is material.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL OWN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Org-wide quality strategy, risk model, and whole-stack standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Release constraints and quality gates; definition of “releasable”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Definition of staged rollout/canary/rollback strategies (to be established with partners)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test architecture principles and automation norms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-stack escape analysis and quality debt for gates and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedding quality craft in engineering; influencing high-risk designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standards for AI-assisted testing and quality expectations for AI-authored code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU’LL PARTNER WITH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; - They implement and own tests/suites in services and clients; you set architecture, gates, and standards, and build quality practice into delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product&lt;/strong&gt; - Journey and tenant/feature priority; acceptance of residual risk within the gates you define.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SRE / Ops&lt;/strong&gt; - Establish and operate rollout strategies together; production signals, incident response, capacity/reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform/tooling&lt;/strong&gt; - CI, environments, shared frameworks, observability for quality signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record as a senior IC in quality engineering (or equivalent) for complex, multi-service products - ideally streaming, media, or similarly high-availability consumer platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing whole-stack quality strategy: backend services, configuration/policy layers, and multi-platform clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to define and land &lt;strong&gt;test architecture&lt;/strong&gt; (pyramid, ownership, cross-stack integration/contract/playback-style validation) that engineering teams can run and own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong influence without authority: you raise the bar inside eng teams, socialize standards, and hold the line on gates without managing a QA org&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering skills at senior level or above; you write production-quality code, not just test scripts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and coding for testability, and building automation as a first-class engineering product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with CI/CD, with a track record of making pipelines faster and more reliable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience applying AI to quality engineering, with judgment on where it reduces risk and where it adds noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort partnering on incidents and turning production failure modes into durable quality improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical judgment on automation: enough to protect risk, not so much that brittle suites block the org&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on engineering background with video ingest, encoding/packaging, playback, or multi-tenant config/policy surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across web, TV, and mobile client quality risk (device/OS/store constraints)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WHY JOIN US?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Zattoo, you’re always on firm ground with real freedom to explore. You’ll have the support and opportunity you need to go far, while you’re helping us create a sustainable and entertainment-filled future for all.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reward&lt;/strong&gt;: strong market competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recharge&lt;/strong&gt;: 30 days vacation plus public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulate&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;trust based flexible working hours and the option for remote work worldwide for up to 8 weeks per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;sharing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Free access to the best streaming experience on the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re developing: &lt;/strong&gt;Your own development budget, German classes and Zattoo all-company&amp;nbsp;hack days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re inclusive: ‘&lt;/strong&gt;Zattooies’ are a fun, engaged, and diverse team made up of 47 nationalities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re healthy:&lt;/strong&gt; Health checks, mental wellbeing support, team sports and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re responsible:&lt;/strong&gt; We are carbon neutral, an active employee Green team, discounted BVG tickets and free bike rentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re sociable: &lt;/strong&gt;A&amp;nbsp;calendar of events with fireside chats, lunches, in-house bar, BBQ’s, monthly socials, summer party and an annual off-site event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zattoo enables our users to view indiscriminately and we reflect that in our team too. Regardless of race, gender, sexual orientation, religion, national origin, age, disability or any other characteristic protected by law we encourage everyone to apply and will give everyone equal consideration. We are an equal opportunities employer — join us and help build a diverse team dedicated to revolutionising the way you watch TV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to ensuring fair, open, and equitable hiring practices and are happy to answer any questions you may have about us or the role throughout the whole process. In line with the EU Pay Transparency Directive, we share the applicable compensation range with you before your first interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-justify&quot;&gt;You can learn more about us at: &lt;a href=&quot;https://zattoo.com/company/jobs/&quot;&gt;https://zattoo.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You just graduated and you know you want a commercial career, but you&#39;re not sure which lane yet. Sales? Account management? Something else?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;12 months inside Flexport&#39;s commercial engine. Four rotations, four mentors, one goal: find where you fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Months 1–3: Open doors as an SDR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Months 4–6: Manage clients as an Account Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Months 7–9: Close deals alongside a top salesperson&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Months 10–12: Go deep in Operations, Marketing, or Customs — your pick&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have a named 1:1 mentor each block, plus one programme-wide buddy who stays with you the entire year. You&#39;ll also build with low-code tools alongside our engineering team. Global trade runs on tech now, not just relationships.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The payoff: after a successful completion of the program you will get a permanent Account Executive, Business Development Rep, or Account Manager role by month 12, plus a company-wide network most new hires take years to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Block 1 – Sales Development: generate pipeline through outbound outreach, qualify leads, and keep Salesforce updated.&lt;br&gt;Block 2 – Account Management: support client meetings, identify upsell/renewal opportunities, and learn the customer lifecycle.&lt;br&gt;Block 3 – Sales: support a full sales cycle from discovery to close, including deal structuring and negotiation.&lt;br&gt;Block 4 – Elective: complete a project in Operations, Marketing, or Customs of your choice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside all four blocks, you&#39;ll also join Engineering sessions every two weeks, learn low-code/no-code tools, and build your own capstone project by year-end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Is this you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• A recent graduate (Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s) — any discipline&lt;br&gt;• Fluent in German and English&lt;br&gt;• Willing to relocate to Hamburg or Frankfurt&lt;br&gt;• Strong affinity with commercial roles but unsure which exact direction&lt;br&gt;• Comfortable learning new tools and systems&lt;br&gt;• No sales experience required&lt;br&gt;• Solution-oriented, self-motivated, detail-oriented and organised&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that fluency in both German and English is required. We kindly ask our candidates to apply with a CV in English! :-)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in there for you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to contribute to one of the fastest-growing companies, where you’ll have the chance to create a global impact while being a part of a&amp;nbsp; thriving multinational environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch food delivery 4 days a week incl. vegetarian options, a salad bar and special menu options, plus breakfast options, snacks, soft drinks and barista coffee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance:&amp;nbsp; employee contribution part is covered by Flexport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid vacation days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity program: every team member becomes a shareholder, aligning our success with yours. As a private company in a multi-trillion dollar industry, you have a direct stake in our collective growth and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program through Aetna Resources for Living: Flexport provides an employer-sponsored program at no cost to you and your household members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave benefit: Flexport is here to support you and your families in one of the most important times in life – the birth of a child! Our parental leave program allows both mothers and partners to take time off from work for pregnancy, childbirth, and to bond with your new child.&lt;/li&gt;
